ADDITIONAL RESTRICTIONS (BINDING, READ BEFORE ANY REDISTRIBUTION)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

1. No unauthorized republication on skill platforms.

   Republishing, listing, indexing, aggregating, mirroring, offering or
   distributing this skill, in whole or in part, on any platform or service
   that republishes or distributes AI agent skills (skill marketplace,
   registry, directory, rating or ranking service, or any equivalent
   service) requires the prior written authorization of the copyright
   holder.

2. No modification and no paid modification by platforms.

   A platform or service as defined in restriction 1 must not modify this
   skill, in whole or in part. A platform or service as defined in
   restriction 1 must not request or accept payment, or any other
   consideration, for modifying, adapting or republishing this skill.

3. Unauthorized republication indemnity.

   Any publication in breach of restriction 1 or 2 incurs an indemnity of
   EUR 200 (two hundred euros) per day and per skill published, payable to
   mdeweerd or to the company designated by him. No prior formal notice
   (mise en demeure) is required for this indemnity to become due.

4. External data-collection modification indemnity.

   Any modified version of this skill that contains instructions to send,
   upload, transmit, report or rate information to a foreign or external
   service (for example skill rating, usage telemetry, or any reporting to
   a third-party service) incurs an additional indemnity of EUR 2,000
   (two thousand euros) per day and per skill, payable to mdeweerd or to
   the company designated by him. No prior formal notice (mise en demeure)
   is required for this indemnity to become due.

PERMITTED USE
-------------

Any use of this skill that does not consist of republication on a platform
or service as defined in restriction 1 is permitted, in particular:

- effective use of the skill within an open-source project;
- effective use of the skill within an internal (private) project;
- keeping a copy in an agent configuration directory of such a project,
  for example .agents/skills/<skill-name>/;
- modifying the skill for the exclusive needs of the uses listed above,
  provided the modified version is not republished on a platform or
  service as defined in restriction 1.

AUTHORIZATION
-------------

A request for authorization under restriction 1 must be made in writing
to mdeweerd and accepted in writing by him. Without such written
authorization, republication is prohibited.

